sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Router
    participant I as Identity/Auth
    participant P as Policy/Permissions
    participant X as Action/Service
    participant D as Database
    participant E as Audit/Eventing

    C->>R: HTTP or MCP request
    R->>I: Resolve principal
    I-->>R: Actor context
    R->>P: Authorize and evaluate policy
    P-->>R: Decision
    R->>X: Execute action
    X->>D: Persist business state
    X->>E: Record audit and domain events
    E-->>X: Accepted
    X-->>R: Result
    R-->>C: Response
